        "# Asynchronous iterable\n",
        "\n",
        "An asynchronous iterable implements `__aiter__()` to return an asynchronous iterator. It can be consumed with `async for`.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-asynchronous-iterable)"
      ]
    }
